<title>ARGENTINA: RESEARCH ALERT - Argentina's CIADEA downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Argentina's CIADEA downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ABN AMRO announced Friday it was downgrading Argentina's CIADEA, which makes Peugeot cars under license, to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are lowering our estimates and changing our 12-month target price to 5.50 pesos (dollars) from 5,90 pesos per share,&quot; analyst Fernando Romero Carranza wrote in a report.</p>
</text>
